      "writtenOn": "2023-02-10T06:03:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "See b/121231426 for some context.  The old `TARGET_BUILD_APPS` was conflating multiple concepts, in this case the relevant ones are whether frameworks/base is present and whether we are building something for distribution outside the platform.\n\nThere\u0027s no reason for a build of a distributable artifact to always use prebuilts, and using the prebuilts was causing extra round trips through building and submitting new prebuilts.  `UNBUNDLED_BUILD_SDKS_FROM_SOURCE` decouples distributable builds from the prebuilts.",
      "parentUuid": "baf215b9_fef29b6c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 10,
        "startChar": 40,
        "endLine": 11,
        "endChar": 18
